{"book":"3Jo","name":"3 John","chapters":{"1":{"1":{"text":"The elder unto the wellbeloved Gaius, whom I love in the truth.","words":[{"t":"The"},{"t":"elder","s":["G4245"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"wellbeloved","s":["G27"]},{"t":"Gaius,","s":["G1050"]},{"t":"whom","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"I","s":["G1473"]},{"t":"love","s":["G25"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth.","s":["G225"]}]},"2":{"text":"Beloved, I wish above all things that thou mayest prosper and be in health, even as thy soul prospereth.","words":[{"t":"Beloved,","s":["G27"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"wish","s":["G2172"]},{"t":"above","s":["G4012"]},{"t":"all"},{"t":"things","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"thou","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"mayest"},{"t":"prosper","s":["G2137"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"be"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"health,","s":["G5198"]},{"t":"even"},{"t":"as","s":["G2531"]},{"t":"thy","s":["G4675"]},{"t":"soul","s":["G5590"]},{"t":"prospereth.","s":["G2137"]}]},"3":{"text":"For I rejoiced greatly, when the brethren came and testified of the truth that is in thee, even as thou walkest in the truth.","words":[{"t":"For","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"rejoiced","s":["G5463"]},{"t":"greatly,","s":["G3029"]},{"t":"when"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"brethren","s":["G80"]},{"t":"came","s":["G2064"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"testified","s":["G3140"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth","s":["G225"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"is"},{"t":"in"},{"t":"thee,","s":["G4675"]},{"t":"even"},{"t":"as","s":["G2531"]},{"t":"thou","s":["G4771"]},{"t":"walkest","s":["G4043"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth.","s":["G225"]}]},"4":{"text":"I have no greater joy than to hear that my children walk in truth.","words":[{"t":"I"},{"t":"have","s":["G2192"]},{"t":"no","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"greater","s":["G3186","G5130"]},{"t":"joy","s":["G5479"]},{"t":"than"},{"t":"to","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"hear","s":["G191"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"my","s":["G1699"]},{"t":"children","s":["G5043"]},{"t":"walk","s":["G4043"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"truth.","s":["G225"]}]},"5":{"text":"Beloved, thou doest faithfully whatsoever thou doest to the brethren, and to strangers;","words":[{"t":"Beloved,","s":["G27"]},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"doest","s":["G4160"]},{"t":"faithfully","s":["G4103"]},{"t":"whatsoever","s":["G3739","G1437"]},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"doest","s":["G2038"]},{"t":"to","s":["G1519"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"brethren,","s":["G80"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"to","s":["G1519"]},{"t":"strangers;","s":["G3581"]}]},"6":{"text":"Which have borne witness of thy charity before the church: whom if thou bring forward on their journey after ➔ a godly sort, thou shalt do well:","words":[{"t":"Which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"have"},{"t":"borne"},{"t":"witness","s":["G3140"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"thy","s":["G4675"]},{"t":"charity","s":["G26"]},{"t":"before","s":["G1799"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"church:","s":["G1577"]},{"t":"whom","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"if"},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"bring"},{"t":"forward"},{"t":"on"},{"t":"their"},{"t":"journey","s":["G4311"]},{"t":"after","s":["G516"]},{"t":"➔"},{"t":"a"},{"t":"godly","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"sort,","s":["G516"]},{"t":"thou"},{"t":"shalt"},{"t":"do","s":["G4160"]},{"t":"well:","s":["G2573"]}]},"7":{"text":"Because that for ➔ his name's sake they went forth, taking nothing of the Gentiles.","words":[{"t":"Because"},{"t":"that","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"for","s":["G5228"]},{"t":"➔"},{"t":"his","s":["G846"]},{"t":"name's","s":["G3686"]},{"t":"sake","s":["G5228"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"went"},{"t":"forth,","s":["G1831"]},{"t":"taking","s":["G2983"]},{"t":"nothing","s":["G3367"]},{"t":"of","s":["G575"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Gentiles.","s":["G1484"]}]},"8":{"text":"We therefore ought to receive such, that we might be fellowhelpers to the truth.","words":[{"t":"We","s":["G2249"]},{"t":"therefore","s":["G3767"]},{"t":"ought","s":["G3784"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"receive","s":["G618"]},{"t":"such,","s":["G5108"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"might"},{"t":"be","s":["G1096"]},{"t":"fellowhelpers","s":["G4904"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth.","s":["G225"]}]},"9":{"text":"I wrote unto the church: but Diotrephes, who loveth to have the preeminence among them, receiveth us not.","words":[{"t":"I"},{"t":"wrote","s":["G1125"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"church:","s":["G1577"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"Diotrephes,","s":["G1361"]},{"t":"who","s":["G3588"]},{"t":"loveth"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"preeminence","s":["G5383"]},{"t":"among"},{"t":"them,","s":["G846"]},{"t":"receiveth","s":["G1926"]},{"t":"us","s":["G2248"]},{"t":"not.","s":["G3756"]}]},"10":{"text":"Wherefore, if I come, I will remember his deeds which he doeth, prating against us with malicious words: and not content therewith, neither doth ➔ he himself receive the brethren, and forbiddeth them that would, and casteth them out of the church.","words":[{"t":"Wherefore,","s":["G1223","G5124"]},{"t":"if","s":["G1437"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"come,","s":["G2064"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"will"},{"t":"remember","s":["G5279"]},{"t":"his","s":["G846"]},{"t":"deeds","s":["G2041"]},{"t":"which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"doeth,","s":["G4160"]},{"t":"prating"},{"t":"against","s":["G5396"]},{"t":"us","s":["G2248"]},{"t":"with","s":["G3056"]},{"t":"malicious"},{"t":"words:","s":["G4190"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"content","s":["G714"]},{"t":"therewith,","s":["G1909","G5125"]},{"t":"neither","s":["G3777"]},{"t":"doth","s":["G1926"]},{"t":"➔"},{"t":"he"},{"t":"himself","s":["G846"]},{"t":"receive","s":["G1926"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"brethren,","s":["G80"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"forbiddeth","s":["G2967"]},{"t":"them"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"would,","s":["G1014"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"casteth","s":["G1544"]},{"t":"them"},{"t":"out"},{"t":"of","s":["G1537"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"church.","s":["G1577"]}]},"11":{"text":"Beloved, follow not that which is evil, but that which is good. He that doeth good is of God: but he that doeth evil hath ➔ not seen God.","words":[{"t":"Beloved,","s":["G27"]},{"t":"follow","s":["G3401"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"which"},{"t":"is"},{"t":"evil,","s":["G2556"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"which"},{"t":"is"},{"t":"good.","s":["G18"]},{"t":"He"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"doeth"},{"t":"good","s":["G15"]},{"t":"is","s":["G2076"]},{"t":"of","s":["G1537"]},{"t":"God:","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"but","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"doeth"},{"t":"evil","s":["G2554"]},{"t":"hath","s":["G3708"]},{"t":"➔"},{"t":"not","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"seen","s":["G3708"]},{"t":"God.","s":["G2316"]}]},"12":{"text":"Demetrius hath good report of all men, and of the truth itself: yea, and we also bear record; and ye know that our record is true.","words":[{"t":"Demetrius","s":["G1216"]},{"t":"hath"},{"t":"good"},{"t":"report","s":["G3140"]},{"t":"of","s":["G5259"]},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"men,"},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"of","s":["G5259"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth","s":["G225"]},{"t":"itself:","s":["G846"]},{"t":"yea,","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"we","s":["G2249"]},{"t":"also"},{"t":"bear"},{"t":"record;","s":["G3140"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"ye"},{"t":"know","s":["G1492"]},{"t":"that","s":["G3754"]},{"t":"our","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"record","s":["G3141"]},{"t":"is","s":["G2076"]},{"t":"true.","s":["G227"]}]},"13":{"text":"I had many things to write, but I will not with ink and pen write unto thee:","words":[{"t":"I"},{"t":"had","s":["G2192"]},{"t":"many"},{"t":"things","s":["G4183"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"write,","s":["G1125"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"will","s":["G2309"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"with","s":["G1223"]},{"t":"ink","s":["G3188"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"pen","s":["G2563"]},{"t":"write","s":["G1125"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"thee:","s":["G4671"]}]},"14":{"text":"But I trust I shall ➔ shortly see thee, and we shall speak face to face. Peace be to thee. Our friends salute thee. Greet the friends by name.","words":[{"t":"But","s":["G1161"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"trust","s":["G1679"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"shall","s":["G1492"]},{"t":"➔"},{"t":"shortly","s":["G2112"]},{"t":"see","s":["G1492"]},{"t":"thee,","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"shall"},{"t":"speak","s":["G2980"]},{"t":"face","s":["G4750"]},{"t":"to","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"face.","s":["G4750"]},{"t":"Peace","s":["G1515"]},{"t":"be"},{"t":"to"},{"t":"thee.","s":["G4671"]},{"t":"Our"},{"t":"friends","s":["G5384"]},{"t":"salute","s":["G782"]},{"t":"thee.","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"Greet","s":["G782"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"friends","s":["G5384"]},{"t":"by","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"name.","s":["G3686"]}]}}}}